{
  "about": "Which parts of mopt-rs can be used from Rust and from Python. 'components' pairs Rust modules or items (paths below crates/mopt-rs/src, '::'-separated) with the Python names that reach them. 'pending' lists Rust modules that Python cannot reach yet (to be emptied; MOPT_API_PARITY_RELEASE=1 makes that an error). 'rust_only' and 'python_only' list what exists on one side by nature, with the reason. tests/test_api_parity.py and crates/mopt-rs/tests/api_parity.rs check that every Rust module and every public Python name is accounted for and that the named items exist.",
